        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PNR04, 1-1/2\" Diameter Reeded Pioneer Brass Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Reeded Pioneer Door Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, back-to-back mounting, or surface mounting. The Reeded Pioneer Door Pull is available in a huge selection of finishes. This traditional door handle can be used in both residential or commercial settings.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PNR04 Pioneer Collection Series 4 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PNR04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262330\"><b>First Impressions PNR04 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-PNR04018:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.69\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PNR04024:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.69\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PNR04036:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.69\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 8 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Reeded Pioneer Door Pull",
                "description": "The Traditional Reeded Pioneer Door Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, back-to-back mounting, or surface mounting. The Reeded Pioneer Door Pull is available in a huge selection of finishes. This traditional door handle can be used in both residential or commercial settings.",
